OL,4,CMy bioethanol heater exploded and set  
OL,5,Cme on fire - I thought I would die     
OL,6,GA mother is trying to rebuild her life 
OL,7,Gafter a summer evening with family and 
OL,8,Gfriends "turned into a nightmare" when 
OL,9,Gher table top heater exploded.         
OL,11,FSaffron Carthew had fourth-degree      
OL,12,Fburns and severe injuries from smoke   
OL,13,Finhalation before being placed in an   
OL,14,Finduced coma for five weeks after the  
OL,15,FJuly explosion caused her skin and     
OL,16,Fhair to "fall off".                    
OL,18,FShe had bought the fire on social      
OL,19,Fmedia, and is now raising awareness    
OL,20,Fabout the pitfalls of online           
OL,21,Fmarketplaces.                          
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
