OL,4,CManic Street Preachers frontman feels  
OL,5,C'more pressure' playing in Wales       
OL,6,GManic Street Preachers frontman James  
OL,7,GDean Bradfield said playing in Wales   
OL,8,Gbrings "extra pressure" as the band    
OL,9,Gprepare to mark 35 years of their      
OL,10,Gdebut album.                           
OL,12,FThe band will headline Blackweir       
OL,13,FFields in Cardiff next summer,         
OL,14,Fperforming the landmark 1992 record    
OL,15,FGeneration Terrorists in full.         
OL,17,FBradfield said their rock songs about  
OL,18,Fbanking, environmental damage and      
OL,19,Fideology still "have a prescience for  
OL,20,Fanything you could talk about now".    
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
