OL,4,CMP calls for action after her likeness 
OL,5,Cused for AI porn deepfakes             
OL,6,GA member of parliament whose name and  
OL,7,Gimage were used in AI content on porn  
OL,8,Gsites said the issue could make women  
OL,9,Gless likely to want to enter public    
OL,10,Glife.                                  
OL,12,FMims Davies, the shadow Welsh          
OL,13,FSecretary, said she received an email  
OL,14,Fin her parliamentary inbox which said  
OL,15,F"her likeness was found on forums in   
OL,16,Fabusive and pornographic content".     
OL,18,FThe Conservative frontbencher said     
OL,19,Fpeople making money from deepfakes was 
OL,20,F"grotesque", urging people to report   
OL,21,Fit if it happens to them so that       
OL,22,F"culprits can be held to account".G4/4 
